<title>USA: Midwest Express names safety director.</title>
<headline>Midwest Express names safety director.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Midwest Express Holdings Inc said Midwest Express Airlines named Christopher White its director of safety and regulatory compliance.</p>
<p>In his new position, which is effective October 1, White will be responsible for ensuring that the Milwaukee-based carrier meets the highest levels of federal and company safety requirements.</p>
<p>Additionally, he will serve as Midwest Express' representative on the Air Transport Association's Safety Council, an industry group dedicated to airline safety.</p>
<p>Prior to joining Midwest Express, White spent eight years with Boeing Co's Commercial Airplane Group.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk - 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
